// Template for the local secrets file. Copy this file to:
//   ../../Config/Secrets.xcconfig   (i.e. sibling of Movter.xcodeproj, NOT inside this folder)
// and fill in real values. That location is outside git, so the file is never committed.
//
// It is NOT a way to keep this key secret from people running the app. Xcode
// substitutes the value into Info.plist at build time, so it ships inside the app
// bundle in cleartext and anyone with a copy of the build can read it back out.
// Treat it as public: use a key you are willing to expose, and rely on TMDB's rate
// limits rather than on secrecy. A key that must actually stay secret has to live
// behind a server the app calls, not in the bundle.
TMDB_API_KEY = your_tmdb_api_key
